WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:04.570
Hi, everyone, we're going to start
Kaleido Star.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:07.410
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.840
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.510
Well, well, well,
do you have someone you like?

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.280
He makes your heart ache.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.020
He's someone you exchange
diaries with and hold hands.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.750
One day, I hope I fall in love
with someone wonderful too.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.960
I hope! I hope...

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:28.020
Huh? Ken, why are you crying?

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:35.700
<i>Dare mo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:35.700
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be someplace</i>

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.210
<i>Dokoka ni aru</i>

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.210
<i>It has to be somewhere</i>

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:45.910
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja nai</i>

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:45.910
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:00:53.960 --> 00:01:00.260
<i>Saigo made yareru to ittetane</i>

00:00:53.960 --> 00:01:00.260
<i>Remember how I used to say
I could make it to the end?</i>

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:06.640
<i>Kitto tsuyogatte itanda</i>

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:06.640
<i>I must have been pretending to be tough</i>

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:15.340
<i>Itsudatte muchabakka de
zutto karamawari de</i>

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:15.340
<i>Everything I did was reckless
and it never got me anywhere</i>

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:21.870
<i>Dakedo anata dake ga soba ni ita</i>

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:21.870
<i>But you alone were always beside me</i>

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:28.590
<i>Daremo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:28.590
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be somewhere</i>

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:31.190
<i>Aruki daseru</i>

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:31.190
<i>You can start going forward</i>

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:36.730
<i>Koko kara nani kaga hajimaru</i>

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:36.730
<i>From this moment, something will start</i>

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.770
<i>Shinjite itai</i>

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.770
<i>I want to believe that</i>

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:46.270
<i>Mada minu hikari yakusoku no
basho e to tsuzuite yuku</i>

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:46.270
<i>The light I haven't seen yet
is beaming toward the promised place</i>

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:56.740
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja naisa</i>

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:56.740
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:21.170
Here, wake up, wake up!

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:27.080
The Diva's Amazing Love

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.090
The Diva's Amazing Love

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.090
"The Diva's Amazing Love"

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:32.680
The Diva's Amazing Love

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.860
Just because it's your day off,

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:37.020
doesn't mean you should keep sleeping
as long as you want.

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:41.820
Excuse me, but I'd been working
at Theatrical Camp until yesterday.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.070
You met Pamela, didn't you?

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:45.790
Was she doing all right?

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:46.940
Yes.

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:49.030
She showed me an
amazing maneuver of hers.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:51.030
Yeah, yeah. I remember that.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:53.340
But the success rate
of that maneuver was very low,

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:56.740
and she was seldom allowed
to do it in a real show.

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:58.780
I see...

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:02.250
It's true. If she fails that maneuver,
it wouldn't be surprising.

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:05.550
Even though I actually saw that,
it was like I saw a miracle.

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.880
It just gave me chills.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:11.760
Jumping straight up and grabbing
the same swing she jumped from...

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:15.860
I wonder if the Legendary Great Maneuver
is like that.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:18.960
It seems that Kaleido Stage
wasn't a suitable place for her.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:23.130
Here, it's finished. Thanks, Sora.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:26.100
Being a Dorm Supervisor is not an easy job.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:27.980
That's right. Please be thankful.

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:28.680
This is it. This is it. Is she here?

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:28.680
That's right. Please be thankful.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.470
This is it. This is it. Is she here?

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:31.680
Miss Sarah!

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:32.580
Miss Sarah Dupont.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:32.580
Miss Sarah!

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:32.950
Aren't you here?

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:33.880
Please come out.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:33.880
Aren't you here?

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.540
Me?

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.520
Are they mass media people?

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:39.750
I found her!

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:41.690
We're running away, Sora!

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:41.990
What? Why?

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:41.990
We're running away, Sora!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:42.790
What? Why?

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.660
Wait!

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.360
What did you do, Miss Sarah?!

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:50.970
Oh...

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:52.730
What happened?

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.740
I can't run anymore.

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:56.500
Please run away by yourself, Sora.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.640
So, why do I have to run away?

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:58.870
Miss Sarah!

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:58.870
So, why do I have to run away?

00:03:58.870 --> 00:03:59.740
Please wait!

00:03:58.870 --> 00:03:59.740
Oh!

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.440
Miss Sarah!

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:07.010
Sarah...

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:13.390
I came here for you, my eternal diva.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:14.750
Andy...

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:18.530
Miss Sarah Dupont,

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:24.930
so the rumor is true that you're moving to
Andy Lowe's major label, ADX?

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:27.330
I think I already said no.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:28.500
It's true.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:29.670
Andy!

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.470
What?! What?!

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:32.940
What are you saying?

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:34.700
I'm not going anywhere.

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:37.610
If you're worried about Kalos,
he already said okay.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.670
What?

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:41.520
So, is it true you are dating?

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:43.220
Who knows?

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:44.650
Please pose for us as a pair.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.350
Make sure we both look nice.

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:50.390
Ouch!

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.430
Ouch!

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:59.400
I will be nice enough to stop right here today.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.200
As for the rest of questions,
this girl will answer for me.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:04.170
Uh...

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:05.440
So, how is it?

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.010
What is the truth?

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.010
So, how is it?

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:06.470
What is the truth?

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:06.470
What is their relationship?

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:07.300
What is their relationship?

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:11.870
I don't know. I don't! I don't!

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.740
I'm sorry... I can't help you guys.

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.050
What was that?

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.690
They were talking about Miss Sarah
moving to a major label.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:28.620
But she's not leaving Kaleido Stage I hope...

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.070
What?! Miss Sarah is crying.

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:43.570
I can't believe it.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.910
It's open.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.690
Miss Sarah...

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.130
Sora...

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:04.630
May I come in?

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:07.170
Please.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:08.640
Sorry about earlier.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.410
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:13.070
So, the mass media people aren't
coming here anymore?

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:14.010
They were here,

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:17.240
but they left as soon as they found out
that I wasn't interested in talking.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:20.070
A picture?

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:22.220
Yes. From ten years ago.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:24.290
Ten years ago?

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:25.380
That's right.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.390
A picture of Andy, Kalos and me...

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:29.420
Really...

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:31.890
Miss Sarah, Mr. Andy and Kalos...

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:32.860
KA-

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.120
KALOS?!

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:37.890
You've got good, tight muscles!

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.470
You fill the spot.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:41.390
You don't have a role.

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:46.000
Why does he look so nice?!

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:50.410
Back then, we were always hungry,

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.140
but our hearts were filled with dreams.

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:55.880
Andy was into writing music.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.510
I was into singing,

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.380
and Kalos was aiming to be a magician.

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:06.590
Kalos was the most popular among us three.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.760
And he became popular enough that
he could have his own show in Las Vegas.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.260
But...

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:20.800
He injured his fingers.

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:23.550
Didn't they get better?

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:26.010
Not enough to perform magic again.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.480
He got the insurance money from the
policy he had taken out on his fingers.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.620
But,

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:38.290
Kalos used that as startup capital for
Kaleido Stage, another dream of his.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.920
He spent everything he had.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.830
Everything...

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.930
Isn't he extreme?

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:47.970
But I followed Kalos.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.210
Kalos told me not to do it.

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:53.570
But it was obvious that he was just bluffing.

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:57.850
But Miss Sarah, weren't you aiming
to be a singer, weren't you?

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:59.010
Yes, I was.

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:01.250
But, you followed Boss...

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.250
Hm?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.650
I think I was in love.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:06.250
Oh. You were in...

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.120
LOVE?!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.490
You fill the spot.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:12.160
I want you to do it.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:13.560
If you don't like it, leave!

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.570
The image I have in mind is
completely different...

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:20.070
Well, of course, I'm still in love, but...

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:21.740
E-Even now?!

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:24.230
I didn't know that.

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:27.570
It's not like I was hiding it.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.010
To be certain,

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:32.140
if you said I don't look like it,
then I can't help it.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:33.450
But...

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:37.250
Then, did you give up your
dream for the Boss?

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:38.420
What?

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:41.590
No. It's not like I gave up my dream.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:43.420
My dream just changed.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:47.360
In those days, I wished I could
sing for everybody in the world.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:48.890
But now...

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.630
I enjoy singing here.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:55.800
I love everybody and I think
this is the place best suited for me.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.940
Not only that,

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:00.530
I thought the feeling that I'm needed

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:03.300
is something I can't replace
with anything else.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.480
But...

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.810
I'm afraid he no longer needs me.

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:14.310
Ten years...

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:20.590
I'm sure Miss Sarah was crying back then.

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:22.800
Unless the Boss stops her,

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:26.230
I'm sure Miss Sarah will move to
Mr. Andy's recording company.

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:30.840
Boss... Please wait a moment!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.570
Boss!

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:33.770
I have something to talk...

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.880
Excuse me!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:40.750
I HAVE SOMETHING
I WANT TO TALK ABOUT!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.880
He ignored me!

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.510
I'm so mad now!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:55.220
What the hell is going on? It's you, Sora.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:02.670
Mr. Policeman, which way did
the Boss's car go?

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:05.830
Don't tell me you're running after a car?

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:08.610
Oh, I see.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:10.780
So, Miss Sarah is in love with Kalos.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:13.350
You never can judge people
by the way they look.

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:14.750
That's for sure.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.850
Anyway, Miss Sarah is facing a big decision,

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.410
so where did he go?

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:20.750
Oh, here he is!

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:22.880
That is...

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:25.590
Hey, that's a very expensive restaurant.

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:26.460
What?

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:27.500
Let's follow him.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.330
Ten-four.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:44.480
Really, how can he go out and have a
gourmet meal in this kind of situation?

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:45.540
Where's the mark?

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:47.120
I found him.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.550
Good. Let's get closer.

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:49.450
Ten-four.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:52.120
Really,

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:56.620
back then, all you thought of was magic.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:11:00.190
Now, all you care about is Kaleido Stage.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.790
I feel sorry for Sarah.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:06.300
So, you're really okay about Sarah, right?

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.140
Yeah. I don't need her anymore.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.200
He doesn't need her?

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:29.720
Back then, I stood no chance against you.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:31.790
But, it's different now.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:35.560
I can introduce Sarah to the world.

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:36.960
And...

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:41.060
Unlike you, I sincerely love Sarah.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:44.470
Please give a toast to me and Sarah.

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:46.360
A toast?

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:46.970
All right.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:47.540
What?!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:47.540
All right.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:47.840
What?!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:50.110
WAIT!

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:54.350
Sora.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.320
Do you know her?

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:57.520
She is in our cast.

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:58.450
What are you doing?

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:00.290
That's my line!

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:01.790
Without asking how Miss Sarah feels,

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.660
why are you making decisions
as you please?

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.130
It's none of your business.

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:06.130
Leave.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:08.720
No, I won't! Please listen to my story!

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:09.730
Leave!

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:09.930
No, I will not! Please listen to me!

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:09.930
Leave!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:11.330
No, I will not! Please listen to me!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:11.730
No, I will not! Please listen to me!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:11.730
I refuse. Leave!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:12.330
I refuse. Leave!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.600
No, I won't! Please listen to my story!

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.200
These two are just alike!

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.200
No, I won't! Please listen to my story!

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.070
These two are just alike!
I refuse. Leave!

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:15.940
These two are just alike!

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:15.940
No, I WON'T!

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:17.370
Not until you listen to my story!

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:17.640
Not until you listen to my story!

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:17.640
Okay.

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:18.210
Okay.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.870
Why don't we listen what she has to say?

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:20.670
What do you say, Kalos?

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:24.540
Thank you.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.750
Boss, Miss Sarah loves Kaleido Stage.

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:31.090
She doesn't want to go.

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:34.710
Aren't you lying when you said
that you don't need her?

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.430
What do I gain by telling a lie like that?

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:38.720
I don't need Sarah.

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:42.300
You're terrible, saying something like that.

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:45.990
You asked me a question.
So I just answered the truth.

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:47.940
But,

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:52.630
I know you needed her when you
established Kaleido Stage ten years ago.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.210
So, even now, you must...

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.840
That is what she tells herself.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:00.340
I don't recall ever saying
even a word like that to her.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:06.750
So, you're really saying that you just
used Sarah for ten years?

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:07.850
That's right.

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:13.360
Boss, I thought you were a very difficult,
unreasonable, scary

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:17.100
and unpleasant man who doesn't
listen to others, but...

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:20.470
But you created such a wonderful
Kaleido Stage,

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:24.340
so I thought you must have a good heart.

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:27.770
I never knew you were so cold hearted.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:32.510
Sorry, but I have things to take care of.
I'm leaving now.

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:34.880
I will pick up Sarah sometime today.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:35.780
All right.

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:36.850
Boss!

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:39.450
Are you really sure that it's okay with you?

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:41.480
Boss!

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:51.630
Miss Sarah...

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:52.790
Come in.

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:55.690
Excuse... Oh...

00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:59.830
Sorry. It's such a mess.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:01.180
Miss Sarah...

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:04.950
Andy called and said he would be here
to pick me up by evening.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:08.820
So, pretty soon, I'll be an artist
for the ADX label!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:12.690
If I could, I want to have a
cheerful farewell party,

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:14.180
but... I can't help it.

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:16.920
Miss Sarah, you don't mind doing this?

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:18.890
I don't know.

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:20.130
It's a bit sudden,

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.250
so I'm really not sure right now.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:26.200
But... I've known Kalos for ten years,

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.900
and he has never once lied to me.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:34.910
And Kalos told me that
he didn't need me anymore.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:39.840
So I think he really meant what he said.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:44.850
Miss Sarah...

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.710
When you send me off, please do it
cheerfully with everyone.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:50.750
I'm not good at dealing with gloomy things.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.360
Well, I have a little more work to do.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:56.500
I can ask the moving company
to take care of the big stuff,

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.900
but I'll need the nunchaku and
Chinese broadsword right away, so...

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:06.670
Miss Sarah's picture is already
on the ADX home page.

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.230
They're fast.

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:10.730
I guess there's no stopping it now.

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:14.580
When someone you trusted says
he doesn't need you anymore,

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.380
I think it'd be unbearable to stay.

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:17.490
That's true.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:18.590
According to what I heard,

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:22.420
many recording companies
tried to recruit her in the past.

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:23.960
What?

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:26.260
That means that the Boss
never said anything until now?

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:30.590
I wonder why the Boss said
something like that only now?

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:35.640
Maybe, she suddenly lost value to him.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:38.340
To tell the truth,
there are quite a lot of Sarah fans.

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:41.000
So I'm pretty sure it'll
damage our sales figures.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:43.740
This has to be a love triangle.

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:47.920
I bet their relationship is too
complicated to be described in words.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.010
That sounds good!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:51.690
The love entangled during ten years.
Love! Love! Love!

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.160
Miss Sarah's growing love for Kalos.
Love! Love! Love!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.220
Mr. Andy's love for Miss Sarah.
Love! Love! Love!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:59.090
Kalos withdraws because of his love.
Love! Love! Love!

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.630
And just then, in front of Miss Sarah,

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:02.460
Like a flash of lightning,
appears the girl, Sora!

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:05.790
Troubled Miss Sarah's love, love, love!

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:08.800
You're taking it too far.

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.030
You think?

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:14.270
But, don't you think that maybe
the Boss withdrew himself?

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:18.080
Everything would certainly make sense
if you thought of it that way.

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.170
Yeah...

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.510
I doubt we should leave everything
the way it is.

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:22.750
Seriously...

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:25.820
Here we go again. Sora's specialty.

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:27.560
Shall we stick our nose in?

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:28.890
But, how?

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:32.430
Hm... Let me think about it a little.

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:41.530
The Fool...

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.940
Now there's an interesting card.

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.940
As long as you don't stick to one idea,

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.940
the possibilities will be infinite.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:49.780
However...

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:50.480
Oh...

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:50.580
What?

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:50.580
Oh...

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:51.210
What?

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:52.450
The Fool...

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:53.380
What?

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:54.450
That's it!

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:55.050
Thank you for helping me, Fool!

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:57.420
Do you really know what you're doing?

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:57.420
Thank you for helping me, Fool!

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:00.550
Shall we go?

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:01.520
Yes.

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.550
Miss Sarah...

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:05.160
Oh?

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:06.990
You two are the only ones to send me off?

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:07.900
What happened to Sora?

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:10.730
We have a message for you from Sora.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.600
She said if you want to know how
the Boss feels about you,

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:14.070
please come to the stage.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:17.040
What?! I already know that...

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:19.870
Well, I'm interested.

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:21.210
Andy.

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:28.380
Sora, what?!

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:31.210
I am the mysterious Fool,
Magical Rabbit.

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:34.750
With my magic, I will find out
your true feelings.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.890
Obviously, she has no clue what I meant.

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:40.390
Fool, find anything related to Miss Sarah.

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:41.690
Okay, okay, okay.

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:43.230
What the hell are you doing?!

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:44.030
Get out!

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:51.110
If you want me to get out,
you should tell me the truth.

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:53.400
What's this nonsense about
telling the truth?! I never lie!

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:55.800
That's enough!

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:57.280
No, I won't!

00:17:57.280 --> 00:18:00.180
I will not stop until I find out
what you think of Miss Sarah.

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:02.080
It's none of your business!

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.850
Who cares if it's my business or not?!

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:15.160
I guess I won't have a chance
to sing here anymore.

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:17.600
Then, allow me to speak on your behalf.

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:19.070
"Sarah, please don't go!"

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:19.900
Stop it!

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:22.300
"l need you!"

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:22.370
Sora!

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:22.370
"l need you!"

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:23.070
Sora!

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:23.170
Sora!

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:23.170
"l love you, Sarah!"

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:23.970
"l love you, Sarah!"

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.470
"Please keep singing for
Kaleido Stage, Sarah!"

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:32.200
I don't have any special feelings
towards Sarah!

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:35.780
Okay.

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.080
Ten-four.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.310
Okay, Jonathan.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.090
Ah-hah...

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:43.250
Then let me ask you this.

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.430
What?

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:47.720
Then, how about the picture
sitting over there?

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:51.600
What! When did it...

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:55.170
Please don't underestimate the
power of the Magical Rabbit.

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:57.740
Why do you still keep that
ten year old photo

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.170
from when the three of you were together?

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.010
Sora,

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:06.450
never tell Sarah what I'm going to say now.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.220
It's true, ten years ago...

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:13.520
no, even after that, I needed Sarah.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:17.960
Kaleido Stage needed Sarah's songs,

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.690
and I needed her.

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:24.570
Even when things didn't go well,
and when I was having hard times,

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:27.260
she was always beside me.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.870
Before I knew it,

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:33.930
I couldn't imagine not having her beside me.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:38.080
This may sound conceited,

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:40.210
but if I tell her that I don't need her anymore,

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:43.920
she can go after her dream
without reservations.

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:45.850
And I knew that.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.890
He really is conceited.

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:53.720
But, I didn't have the courage to tell
even a simple lie like that.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:56.030
Without the courage to lose her,

00:19:56.030 --> 00:20:01.590
I've robbed her for ten years
of the chance to make her dreams come true.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.040
This time,

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.100
the offer came from Andy.

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:07.610
I know he can make her dreams come true.

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:14.350
I'm aware that I need Sarah now,
and even in the future, I will need her.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:17.940
But, I don't want her
to know about this right now.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:19.610
Such a fool...

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:23.120
Andy, l...

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:25.760
I understand.

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:27.620
What a farce this has been.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:31.630
When you're tired of Kalos, call me anytime.

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:37.100
If you care about Sarah,
don't tell her what I just told you.

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:37.940
All right?

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:38.970
Too late!

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:39.800
What!

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:41.630
That's right.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:44.380
I heard everything you said.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:45.310
Everything?!

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:47.140
Microphone...

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.150
I will leave both of you alone. Enjoy.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:51.080
Hey!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.160
Kalos,

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.520
you really have no clue, do you?

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:05.400
You have a chance to sing
on the world stage.

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:08.660
Please don't decide my dream
without consulting me.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.170
Right now,

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:14.730
I like Kaleido Stage much more
than the world stage.

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:18.380
Layla, Sora and whenever
we have newcomers,

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:21.210
I like singing here more and more.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:27.610
Besides, you're here.

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:48.410
Now, everyone, this is the first show
after our vacation.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.170
So, let's brace ourselves!

00:21:50.940 --> 00:21:51.770
Yes.

00:21:58.690 --> 00:22:00.120
Curtain's rising!

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:01.280
Yes!

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.280
Next Kaleido Star

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:26.110
I came here to see your regretful face.

00:22:26.180 --> 00:22:29.980
And so, suddenly, my Jr. High school
classmate came to the U.S.

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:31.350
But, something seems wrong with her.

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:32.190
Not only that...

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:33.750
Sora, you don't mind coming along
with me, do you?

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:34.720
What?!

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:36.920
Mr. Yuri asked me out!

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:41.120
Er... uh... well... Oh, dear.
Oh, dear. Oh, dear...

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:42.860
Next time on Kaleido Star
"An Amazing Sinister Rumor"

00:22:42.860 --> 00:22:45.670
An Amazing Sinister Rumor

00:22:42.860 --> 00:22:45.670
Next time on Kaleido Star
"An Amazing Sinister Rumor"

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:51.470
An Amazing Sinister Rumor

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:51.470
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...

00:22:51.470 --> 00:23:04.250
<i>Boku wa koko ni iru
sora to michi no aida de mukai kaze</i>

00:22:51.470 --> 00:23:04.250
<i>I'm here between the sky and the roads,
and facing against the wind</i>

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:18.100
<i>Soshite mae o muiteiru
Mou nido to kanashimi ga furanai youni to</i>

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:18.100
<i>And I'm facing forward so the sorrow
doesn't rain down ever again</i>

00:23:18.100 --> 00:23:24.040
<i>Ano kabe o koete kokomade kitanda</i>

00:23:18.100 --> 00:23:24.040
<i>I came all the way here after
I jumped over that wall</i>

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:31.350
<i>Nigedashitaku naru koto wa nando mo aru</i>

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:31.350
<i>There are many times
when I just want to run away</i>

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:36.720
<i>Dakedo kokoni irunara taishite bibitte inai</i>

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:36.720
<i>But I'm still here,
so, I'm not daunted that much</i>

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:44.160
<i>Kakinaguri no uta "hajimekara yareba iisa"</i>

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:44.160
<i>The poem I scribbled down, I can just
start writing over from the beginning</i>

00:23:44.160 --> 00:23:49.720
<i>Umaku kakenaku te boku wa waratte iru</i>

00:23:44.160 --> 00:23:49.720
<i>Unable to write it well, I'm laughing</i>
